{"unit_id":"CyberryRe__lx_music-for-dsh#card-zh","repo":"CyberryRe/lx_music-for-dsh","commit":"27e56fc720e9887f4ff697e85e314089c0e7160f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"lx-music-for-dsh 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的音乐播放插件，通过侧边栏迷你卡片、主窗口和 LLM 工具提供歌曲搜索、播放、队列管理与播放控制。用户可以按歌名或歌手搜索并筛选平台，把歌曲加入队尾或下一首，管理播放列表和音源，调整音量、音质与播放模式；插件还提供歌词和系统媒体控件。实验性音乐画像默认关闭，开启后可查看偏好并进行精确点播。可使用内置音源引擎，无需自备 API Key；连接 lxserver 时需配置服务地址。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:1","src/index.ts:331","src/tools.ts:227","src/taste/tools.ts:87","cordis.patch.yml:23"]}
{"unit_id":"CyberryRe__lx_music-for-dsh#card-en","repo":"CyberryRe/lx_music-for-dsh","commit":"27e56fc720e9887f4ff697e85e314089c0e7160f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"lx-music-for-dsh adds music search, playback, queue management, and controls to the DSH web client through a sidebar player and LLM tools. It also provides lyrics and system media controls. Music taste features are disabled by default; the built-in source engine needs no user API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client.ts:1","src/index.ts:331","src/tools.ts:227","src/taste/tools.ts:87","cordis.patch.yml:23"]}
